The ported portions are marked at the top of each source file. They were
translated from pdfjs-dist 6.3.289 (the version the TypeScript engine runs
on) and changed from JavaScript to Rust; src/tables.rs is generated from the
same build by oracle/gen-tables.ts.

The Adobe Glyph List and the standard 14 fonts' metrics in src/tables.rs
reach pdf.js from Adobe's published glyph list and AFM files, which Adobe
licenses for this use (BSD-style license, Copyright Adobe Systems).

